# Implementation Plan: Buyer Review & Farmer Reputation Module

This document outlines the architecture for the **Buyer Review & Farmer Reputation Module**. This module builds upon the delivery confirmation system to capture detailed buyer feedback and autonomously update the farmer's reputation metrics across the platform.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Image Uploads**: Implementing full image uploads (Multipart Form Data to S3/Cloudinary) during this local sandbox session introduces significant complexity and external dependencies. I propose mocking the image upload functionality on the frontend (allowing the user to select images visually) but omitting the actual binary storage in the database to keep the backend lean and stable.
> **Blockchain Verification**: The review hash and transaction ID will be simulated and stored in MongoDB to represent the Arbitrum record, similar to the escrow implementation.

